{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "88", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Billy Stanlake is declared the Man of the Match. His spell at the start decided the fate of this match as New Zealand never recovered after that. That's all we have from this game. We look forward to your company on 7th February for the clash between Australia and England in Hobart. Do join us at 1940 local (0840 GMT) for all the action. Cheers!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "87", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Glenn Maxwell gives a quick interview on his way back. He says that he is happy with the team performance. Adds that many of their players have played a lot of domestic cricket and were looking good. On the chase, he replies that they didn't get much from the Powerplay so they tried to score quick runs after that. Mentions that they played to their strengths and he is delighted that Lynn took the pressure off him. On team selection, he says that the players were chosen on current form and good performance in the Big Bash League. He reckons that they want to see more success in this format. On being asked about taking tips from Ricky Ponting, Maxwell replies that he is his idol and he always looks up to him.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "86", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The tourist got two early wickets in the game but didn't apply enough pressure to bottle up Australia. They didn't get the bounce that Stanlake produced which allowed Maxwell and Lynn to go after them. 117 is less on any pitch and after the revised target it became even more difficult for New Zealand. Just the first game of the series, they will take positives from it, if any, and will try to bounce back.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "85", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "A commanding win for this new-look Australia! After a delayed start to the chase, Australia were set a revised target of 95 runs in 15 overs. The hosts approached it with aggressive intent and tried to score quickly. They lost a couple of quick wickets but that didn't stop Maxwell and Lynn from playing their shots. Their partnership worth 77 off 53 balls sealed the deal for the visitors.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.3", "Id": "84", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "6,258,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "FOUR! Maxwell finishes it off in style. Southee pitches it full and around off, Maxwell pounces onto it and spanks it over mid off. One bounce into the fence. AUSTRALIA WIN BY 7 WICKETS (D-L method)!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.2", "Id": "83", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Bouncer by Tim, Glenn ducks.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.1", "Id": "82", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "1,35,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "FOUR! My lord, that's power for you. A length ball around middle, Maxwell walks across the stumps and bludgeons it through square leg. There is a fielder in the deep but before he can react, it has crossed the fence.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.1", "Id": "81", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Wide! Short and angling down the leg side, Maxwell tries to work it around but misses.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "80", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Tim Southee to bowl...", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Alex Carey is in next.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.6", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "OUT! Lynn falls to a short ball. He once again attempts to power his pull shot but fails to get on top of the bounce. As a result, his shot lacks the desired venom to sail into the stand. Sodhi catches it in the deep backward square leg region. For a moment, we thought he misjudged it. But no, was always in control, it's just he didn't bring his body behind and caught it sideways.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "10062", "Summary": {"Score": "87/3", "Over": "11", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10062", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "44", "Balls": "33", "Fours": "6", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "10085", "Runs": "32", "Balls": "21", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4338", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "14", "Wickets": "2"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.5", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "8,321,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "That's a mishit but it still goes like a rocket. Short in length on middle, Lynn powers it with great bat speed, doesn't middle but it races to wide long on. A couple taken.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.4", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "6,259,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Spears it very full around off, Maxwell digs it out to mid off and pinches a run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.3", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "A length ball on middle, Maxwell goes on his toes and defends it back.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.2", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "3,130,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Almost identical to the last delivery, this time Lynn makes connection and slaps it to backward point for a run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.1", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Boult runs in from over the wicket and delivers a shortish ball outside off, Lynn stays back and tries to smash it down the ground but misses.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Trent Boult is back.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "7,278,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "FOUR! No stopping Lynn, he hits it straight back past the bowler for another boundary to end the over. 12 more runs needed.", "Summary": {"Score": "83/2", "Over": "10", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10085", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "31", "Balls": "19", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "10062", "Runs": "41", "Balls": "29", "Fours": "6", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57625", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "24", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.5", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,220,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Easy runs for Australia. Another shot driven through covers to get closer to the total.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "4,176,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Maxwell cuts this ball through point to rotate strike.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,221,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Lynn drives this past covers for another run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.2", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "1,23,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "FOUR! Lynn is in a hurry, pulls this short ball to the deep square leg region for a boundary. 19 more needed.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.1", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,204,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Darts this full, Maxwell lofts it over covers for one.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,193,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57903", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Maxwell rocks onto his back foot and punches this to pick up a run. 12 off the over. Australia need 24 more to win.", "Summary": {"Score": "71/2", "Over": "9", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10085", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "25", "Balls": "16", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "10062", "Runs": "35", "Balls": "26", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57903", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "20", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,207,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57903", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "FOUR! Maxwell goes hard at this full delivery. Floated ball, Maxi drives it through covers for a boundary. Drilled.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,348,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57903", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "In the air...but safe. Nicely tossed up again, Lynn goes for the sweep and the ball gets a bottom edge to it and flies high towards deep square leg. It falls safe and they run through.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57903", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Fires this one. Good change of pace. Lynn hits it back to the bowler.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.2", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57903", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Tosses this one too after being hit for a biggie. Lynn drives this to mid off.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.1", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "1,26,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57903", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "SIX! Tossed up, Lynn goes on one knee and slog sweeps this over mid-wicket for a biggie! That's the fifty-run stand between the two.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "59", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Mitchell Santner to bowl.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.6", "Id": "58", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "4,166,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Lynn cuts this past point for another run.", "Summary": {"Score": "59/2", "Over": "8", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10062", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "28", "Balls": "22", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "10085", "Runs": "20", "Balls": "14", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57625", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.5", "Id": "57", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,206,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Maxwell punches this ball on the off side. Good effort from the cover fielder to restrict it to one.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.4", "Id": "56", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "8,320,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "On the legs of Maxwell who flicks it away to deep square leg for a brace.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.3", "Id": "55", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Defended off the front foot by the batsman presenting the full face of the bat.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.2", "Id": "54", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Cracker of a leg break. Bowls this in line of the stumps and goes past the outside edge of Maxwell. Glenn was completely bamboozled by the turn. There is some turn and grip if the spinners get their pace right.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,300,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Short ball, Lynn punches this one and crosses over.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,205,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11703", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "De Grandhomme punches the ball close to his body past mid on to end the over with a run.", "Summary": {"Score": "54/2", "Over": "7", "Runs": "11", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10062", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "26", "Balls": "20", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "10085", "Runs": "17", "Balls": "10", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "11703", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "11", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.5", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "4,160,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11703", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Maxwell cuts this through point for a quick run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.4", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,297,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11703", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Pitched up, Lynn works it past mid on to rotate strike.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,296,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11703", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "A bit behind the good good length, Maxwell punches this for another run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "6,245,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11703", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "SIX! Effortlessly done! Fuller this time from de Grandhomme, Maxwell extends his arms and lofts it over long on for half a dozen.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.1", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,292,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "11703", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Starts off with a back of a length ball, Lynn punches it on the off side for a run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "De Grandhomme to bowl his first over.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.6", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,318,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Lynn plays it through mid-wicket to retain strike.", "Summary": {"Score": "43/2", "Over": "6", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10062", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "23", "Balls": "17", "Fours": "5", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "10085", "Runs": "9", "Balls": "7", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57625", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.5", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,7,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Enough time for Maxwell to ease it away on the leg for one more.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.4", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,328,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Lynn flicks it away with a wristy shot on the leg side. They pick up a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.3", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "The batsman rocks onto the back foot and punches the ball.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.2", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "4,155,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "FOUR! Wrong one from Sodhi, Lynn cuts it with fast hands and the ball runs away to the backward point region for a boundary. Santner from the deep hares to stop it but his dive too is not enough.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.1", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57625", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "A bit short from Sodhi, Lynn taps it on the off side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Ish Sodhi comes into the attack.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.6", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "3,95,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "FOUR! Cheeky by Maxy! Southee bangs in a short ball outside off, Maxwell stays put inside the crease and just uses the pace of the bowler to ramp it past the keeper. A boundary at third man results, 9 from the over, 36/2 in the Powerplay, 59 needed off 60 balls.", "Summary": {"Score": "36/2", "Over": "5", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10085", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "8", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "10062", "Runs": "17", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4235", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "18", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.5", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Jumps on the back foot to a shortish ball and taps it down to point. One more ball left in the Powerplay.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.4", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "2,70,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Shortish and around leg, cramping Maxwell who tries to glance. It takes his gloves and rolls past the diving keeper to fine leg. The batsmen have picked up a couple of runs.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.3", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "4,140,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Back of a length delivery outside off, Glenn steers it through backward point for a couple.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.3", "Id": "34", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Wide called for height! Southee follows the batsman with a bouncer, Maxwell ducks and lets it through with his bat hanging right up. Not a good technique.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.2", "Id": "33", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Short and around leg, angling down, Maxwell moves across to pull but misses.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.1", "Id": "32", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "10085", "Commentary": "Angles in a length ball on middle and off, Maxwell defends it from the crease.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "31", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Tim Southee gets a change of ends.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.6", "Id": "30", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,197,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57903", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "FOUR! Pierces the gap this time. Flatter delivery in the line of the stumps, Lynn hops back a bit to create room and packs a punch past the cover fielder for a boundary.", "Summary": {"Score": "27/2", "Over": "4", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10062", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "17", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "10085", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "0", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57903", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.5", "Id": "29", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57903", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Quicker ball wide outside off, Lynn smashes it through the line but finds the cover fielder.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.4", "Id": "28", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57903", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Santner slows it up this time. He lands it around middle and off, gets some spin as well. Lynn defends it with an angled bat to point.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.3", "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "1,13,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57903", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "FOUR! Santner drags his length short and bowls it around middle, Lynn gets down on one knee and thwacks it through square leg for a boundary. He picked the length very early there.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.2", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57903", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Tossed up ball on middle, Lynn stays back footed in defense.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.1", "Id": "25", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57903", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Quicker one, around leg, almost a yorker, Lynn digs it back.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "24", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Mitchell Santner to bowl inside the Powerplay.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.6", "Id": "23", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,345,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Fullish and on middle, eased to mid-wicket for a run.", "Summary": {"Score": "19/2", "Over": "3", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10062", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "9", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "10085", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "0", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4338", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "10", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.5", "Id": "22", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Shows the full face of the bat and defends the ball off the back foot.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.4", "Id": "21", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "4,158,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "FOUR! Slashes and slashes hard. Looking in fine touch, Chris. He attacks the delivery outside off and smacks it over point for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.3", "Id": "20", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "4,178,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "FOUR! Powerfully struck! Boult angles a length ball away from the batsman, outside off, Lynn chances his arms and muscles it over covers for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.2", "Id": "19", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Around off, Lynn defends it from the back foot.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "18", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Glenn Maxwell arrives. One big hitter after the other, Australia have plenty of them but who will stay and steer the side home?", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.1", "Id": "17", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "OUT! Fantastic catch in the deep by Bruce to dismiss the Aussie skipper. Body blow to the home team. Boult digs in a sharp short ball on middle, Warner goes for the pull shot and makes decent connection as well. It flies to the deep square leg region where Bruce settles underneath it and takes the catch close to the rope. He realizes that the momentum is taking him behind and hence he tosses the ball up, steps behind the rope and then comes back to complete the catch again. That's smartness for you.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "5380", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.6", "Id": "16", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "10062", "Commentary": "Shows the full face of the bat and defends the ball off the back foot.", "Summary": {"Score": "10/1", "Over": "2", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "10062", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "0", "Balls": "1", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "5380", "Runs": "6", "Balls": "7", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4235", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "15", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Chris Lynn, another batsman known for his big hitting, walks in next.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.5", "Id": "14", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "66573", "Commentary": "OUT! Short's debut innings is cut short. Southee persists with a short of a length delivery outside off, D'Arcy stays back to unfurl another powerful pull shot but fails to middle it well. Still it goes like a rocket to Taylor at short mid-wicket who pouches it easily. Those bucket-like hands of Rosco... Made it look so effortless. New Zealand get the first breakthrough. They need to keep chipping away at the wickets to stay in hunt.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "66573", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.4", "Id": "13", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "66573", "Commentary": "Angling away from the batsman, Short tries another pull shot but misses.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.3", "Id": "12", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "8,338,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "66573", "Commentary": "FOUR! What a shot, Mr. Short! We saw plenty of these in the BBL and now the young man is displaying his talent on the big stage. He rocks back to a shortish ball outside off and blazes his pull shot through mid-wicket for a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.2", "Id": "11", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,340,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Straighter in line, Warner turns it through square leg and takes a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.1", "Id": "10", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,200,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4235", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "FOUR! Southee drops it short first up, wide outside off, Warner exercises his arms and slams it over covers for a boundary. Tim needs to be right on the money as they are not defending a big total.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "9", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Tim Southee will bowl from the other end.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.6", "Id": "8", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "66573", "Commentary": "Punched off the back foot by Short. End of a good over by Boult.", "Summary": {"Score": "1/0", "Over": "1", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "66573", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "0", "Balls": "1", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "5380", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4338", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.5", "Id": "7", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,290,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Length around off, Warner plays it to mid on and they quickly run through. First run on the board.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.4", "Id": "6", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Drags his length back a bit, Warner goes for the pull and the ball hits his arm before dying on the ground.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.3", "Id": "5", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Length ball in line of the stumps, Warner hits it to mid on.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.2", "Id": "4", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Effort ball from Boult, outside off, Warner goes for the cut but it is high and wide above him.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.1", "Id": "3", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4338", "Batsman": "5380", "Commentary": "Starts off with a fuller ball in line of the stumps, Warner taps it on the leg side.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "2", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "We are back for the chase. The umpires and the Kiwis take the field. David Warner and debutant, D'Arcy Short will open for the hosts, whereas Trent Boult will have a first go with the new ball.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "1", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Good news - The rain has stopped. And the players are getting ready to come out. The revised target is 95 and Australia will have to get it in 15 overs.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}], "Deleted_UID": null}, "meta": {"app_status_code": 1, "message": "Success", "pagination": true, "count": 88, "timestamp": {"utc_time": "6/20/2026 7:14:29 AM"}}}